{"id":"e65804647390ea83e7e8a9e8c6d9ca7bf1c1df6f","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/56604","title":"模型没答错，只是没看表：AAAI这篇时序问答方法让AI学会“穿越时间”找答案 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"量子位\n                  2026-07-24 23:10 分享","excerpt":"QC-MHM团队发现，ChatGPT等大模型在处理含时间约束的查询（如“Lasha Talakhadze之前的奥运纪录”“第25届奥运会期间布达佩斯市长”）时普遍存在缺陷：虽能识别实体和基本事实，却常忽略时间限定词，错误返回当前或默认信息而非指定时间点的正确答案。这暴露了模型对动态时序逻辑理解不足、缺乏显式时间推理能力的问题，非个别模型特有，而是当前主流AI系统的共性短板。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"js_content\"><h5 data-nest-level=\"2\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">QC-MHM团队 投稿&#160;</span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">量子位 | 公众号 QbitAI</span></h5><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">向ChatGPT问一个看起来挺简单的问题：“Lasha Talakhadze之前的奥运举重纪录是多少？”</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">结果让人哭笑不得——模型能认出这个人是谁，也说得出来他拿过金牌，但给出来的答案却是</span><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">他现在的纪录</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">，而不是“之前”的。同理，“第25届奥运会期间布达佩斯的市长是谁？”这种带时间窗口约束的问题，Google和ChatGPT都翻了车。</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">这不是某个模型的bug，而是所有基于知识图谱的问答系统共有的结构性问题：</span><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">它们看得见实体，看不见时间。</span></strong></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">北航、复旦、浙大联合团队在AAAI上提出的</span><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">QC-MHM（Question Calibration and Multi-Hop Modeling）</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">，用一个三件套方案——问题校准+时序嵌入+多跳图推理——让模型真正拥有了“时间感”。</span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/44307000887e9d00094eff7d3ff1a5951784905819793.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.21481481481481482\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-width=\"1509\" data-height=\"324\" data-imgfileid=\"100421756\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/44307000887e9d00094eff7d3ff1a5951784905819793.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">作者单位：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">北京航空航天大学·复旦大学·浙江大学</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">发表：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">AAAI（CCF-A类顶会，Pages 19332–19340）</span></p><h2 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">背景</span></h2><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">场景与痛点</span></h4><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">时序知识图谱问答（Temporal KGQA）的任务是：给定一个带时间约束的自然语言问题，从知识图谱中找到</span><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">落在正确时间窗口内的答案</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">。</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">听起来只是在普通KGQA上加了个时间字段？实际上差距巨大：</span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7524884611bfe32e7eddd326a77c200c1784905819793.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5033557046979866\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"894\" data-width=\"894\" data-height=\"450\" data-imgfileid=\"100421755\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7524884611bfe32e7eddd326a77c200c1784905819793.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">举个例子：（布达佩斯，市长，某人，1992）和（布达佩斯，市长，另一人，2024）在KG里是两条不同的事实。传统模型很容易把两条混在一起，问“92年谁当市长”时给出2024年的答案。</span></p><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">现有方法的两大硬伤</span></h4><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">学界已经有了CronKGQA、TMA、TSQA等一系列时序KGQA模型，但这篇AAAI论文犀利地指出，它们都没绕过两个坎：</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">硬伤一：PLM对时间“视而不见”。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">Bert等预训练语言模型编码问题时，注意力天然落在实体名词上（人名、地名），对“之前/之后/期间”这类时间词汇缺乏敏感性。结果就是——模型相当于读了一道“不带时间约束”的问题。</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">硬伤二：图结构信息被浪费。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">即使用了知识图谱，多数方法也只把它当作答案查询的索引，没有真正利用其中蕴含的多跳关系结构。遇到需要“两步以上跳转”的问题就掉链子，而且推理过程完全黑箱。</span></p><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">论文做了什么</span></h4><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">QC-MHM用一个端到端框架把三个模块串起来：</span></p><ul><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">时序感知嵌入：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">让KG中的时间戳知道“谁在前、谁在后”</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">问题校准：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">让问题向量主动去KG中“找时间线索”，再回来更新自己的表示</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">多跳GNN推理：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">单层GNN一次性访问任意跳邻居，同时输出可解释的推理路径</span></section></li></ul><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/8c12c60e7566aa2f85d3cc21e7059cb01784905819794.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.1848852901484481\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"741\" data-width=\"741\" data-height=\"878\" data-imgfileid=\"100421758\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/8c12c60e7566aa2f85d3cc21e7059cb01784905819794.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><h2 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">技术方案</span></h2><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">模块一：让时间戳“懂顺序”的KG嵌入</span></h4><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">KG里每条事实是（主体，关系，客体，时间）四元组。QC-MHM选择</span><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">TComplEx</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">做基础嵌入，评分函数为：</span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/44b2278d7b06b5aa2769100e11d60f291784905819794.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.17307692307692307\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"728\" data-width=\"728\" data-height=\"126\" data-imgfileid=\"100421776\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/44b2278d7b06b5aa2769100e11d60f291784905819794.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">但仅靠TComplEx，时间戳之间还是“散装”的——模型不知道1992在2024之前。为此作者借鉴Transformer的sinusoidal编码，为每个时间戳叠加位置编码：</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/46f8978514575508dfcbf81ba5ca06d01784905819794.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.20376175548589343\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"638\" data-width=\"638\" data-height=\"130\" data-imgfileid=\"100421777\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/46f8978514575508dfcbf81ba5ca06d01784905819794.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">进而构造辅助任务——让模型判断“时间m是否早于时间n”：</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1797e3aed6e4e37b74c3cfed88f2f1fd1784905819794.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.10461538461538461\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"650\" data-width=\"650\" data-height=\"68\" data-imgfileid=\"100421775\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1797e3aed6e4e37b74c3cfed88f2f1fd1784905819794.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e6a4784d6fdc7fcf5ae84dbd2719aec11784905819794.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.05860113421550094\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1058\" data-width=\"1058\" data-height=\"62\" data-imgfileid=\"100421774\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e6a4784d6fdc7fcf5ae84dbd2719aec11784905819794.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">总训练损失：<img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0d55b5dcd8c7542a0691a87b927446971784905819794.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.1888111888111888\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"286\" data-width=\"286\" data-height=\"54\" data-imgfileid=\"100421778\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/0d55b5dcd8c7542a0691a87b927446971784905819794.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">。这个辅助任务就像给模型做“时间排序”的专项训练——嵌入空间里，1992的向量自然排在2024前面。</span></p><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">模块二：问题校准——让问题主动“找时间”</span></h4><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">这是QC-MHM最具想象力的设计。常规做法是：问题→PLM编码→直接查询答案。QC-MHM在中间加了一步：</span><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">让问题先去KG中检索与时序相关的SPO（主体-关系-客体三元组），再回来修正自己的表示。</span></strong></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">第一步：候选SPO召回。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">把问题和KG中的所有SPO分别过SentenceBERT，用余弦相似度排名，保留Top-10：</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/45de208212665ea3c2e9e00c37a6ae4c1784905819794.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2857142857142857\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"378\" data-width=\"378\" data-height=\"108\" data-imgfileid=\"100421780\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/45de208212665ea3c2e9e00c37a6ae4c1784905819794.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">第二步：三注意力多视角匹配。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">用三种注意力机制同时比较“问题词×SPO候选”：</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5b710b980163b60434fa0839e1c1ae991784905819794.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.22489082969432314\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"916\" data-width=\"916\" data-height=\"206\" data-imgfileid=\"100421781\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5b710b980163b60434fa0839e1c1ae991784905819794.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">三种视角各看各的：Concat看“这两个向量放一块合理吗”，Dot看“关键维度上对齐了吗”，Minus看“哪里不一样”。</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">第三步：门控自适应融合。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">让模型自己决定“原始问题语义”和“从KG检索到的时序信息”各占多大权重：</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a18f57e7684fd6f0e142e662bd3e3f3b1784905819794.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2692307692307692\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"728\" data-width=\"728\" data-height=\"196\" data-imgfileid=\"100421782\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/a18f57e7684fd6f0e142e662bd3e3f3b1784905819794.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">经过校准后的问题向量<img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/44fa639c6991afdb18e967541e87e0ba1784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7209302325581395\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"86\" data-width=\"86\" data-height=\"62\" data-imgfileid=\"100421779\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/44fa639c6991afdb18e967541e87e0ba1784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">，从此具备了“时间感”。相当于原本的问题是“XXX是谁？”，校准后变成了“XXX在1992年是谁？”。</span></p><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">模块三：多跳GNN推理——一层看穿整条路径</span></h4><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">传统GNN的问题是：一层只能看1跳邻居，要想看2跳需要堆2层，看3跳得堆3层，效率和可解释性都不好。</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">QC-MHM的做法是：</span><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">先把子图裁剪出来，再一次性做多跳注意力聚合。</span></strong></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">子图裁剪：</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">以问题中的实体为起点，抽取k跳范围内的子图，把搜索空间收窄。</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">路径打分（注意力矩阵）：</span></strong></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/8dfb183e5244c3a90abb4cceed8380a41784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.23404255319148937\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"846\" data-width=\"846\" data-height=\"198\" data-imgfileid=\"100421783\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/8dfb183e5244c3a90abb4cceed8380a41784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">一次性多跳聚合：</span></strong></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7e7497c816facf3f81c74eed91bfb7fd1784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2116788321167883\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"548\" data-width=\"548\" data-height=\"116\" data-imgfileid=\"100421784\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7e7497c816facf3f81c74eed91bfb7fd1784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">核心公式在D：通过加权和把1跳、2跳、…、ℓ跳的注意力矩阵一次性合并，让单层GNN就能访问任意跳邻居。经验设置<img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f0198b5b3a2b849ce7dc9f5e6c1f55dd1784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.4189189189189189\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"148\" data-width=\"148\" data-height=\"62\" data-imgfileid=\"100421787\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/f0198b5b3a2b849ce7dc9f5e6c1f55dd1784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">已能取得理想效果。</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">最终图向量：<img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d47fcffe68f19390c9a0880bb9fb9fc41784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.38\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"300\" data-width=\"300\" data-height=\"114\" data-imgfileid=\"100421785\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d47fcffe68f19390c9a0880bb9fb9fc41784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">注意力权重本身也可以直接可视化，展示模型的“思考轨迹”——哪条边被高权重激活，推理路径一目了然。</span></p><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">模块四：双通道答案预测</span></h4><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">把语义向量<img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/00088bb535a6a1ff1ae24849cf7944cc1784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7160493827160493\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"81\" data-width=\"364\" data-height=\"58\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/A6fTew8FFGFuWO6OpNEjP3QkdRZTIfmicCw4reNORnAoa1AsbRjibOsMbVLiaaHEmy1bWpabLYRc17icDwzibFGhDks9R8EmgQ6treVbS6mVy3Ao/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-cropx1=\"162.47210300429185\" data-cropx2=\"243.70815450643778\" data-cropy1=\"0\" data-cropy2=\"57.80257510729615\" data-imgfileid=\"100421786\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/00088bb535a6a1ff1ae24849cf7944cc1784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">（问题校准后的表示）和图向量<img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ca6fe15f7619b3fb93f8f8a59e632fd91784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.7160493827160493\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"81\" data-width=\"364\" data-height=\"58\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/A6fTew8FFGFuWO6OpNEjP3QkdRZTIfmicCw4reNORnAoa1AsbRjibOsMbVLiaaHEmy1bWpabLYRc17icDwzibFGhDks9R8EmgQ6treVbS6mVy3Ao/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-cropx1=\"262.4549356223176\" data-cropx2=\"343.6909871244635\" data-cropy1=\"0\" data-cropy2=\"57.80257510729615\" data-imgfileid=\"100421786\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/ca6fe15f7619b3fb93f8f8a59e632fd91784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">（GNN聚合后的表示）拼接，过一层Transformer融合：</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3c2e9105f655f1f3a99f3522815f26cd1784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.15934065934065933\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"364\" data-width=\"364\" data-height=\"58\" data-imgfileid=\"100421786\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3c2e9105f655f1f3a99f3522815f26cd1784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">然后分别投影到</span><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">实体空间</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">和</span><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">时间戳空间</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">，用TComplEx评分做双通道预测：</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/83d05fe85fba2db82225bde44fa743a81784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.2857142857142857\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"476\" data-width=\"476\" data-height=\"136\" data-imgfileid=\"100421788\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/83d05fe85fba2db82225bde44fa743a81784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">两个通道的分数拼接后softmax，交叉熵优化。这意味着——同一个模型可以同时回答“是谁”和“什么时候”两类问题。</span></p><h2 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">实验结果</span></h2><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">CronQuestions：逼近性能天花板</span></h4><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4b41799f7692af039555c662999e54a31784905819795.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.42962962962962964\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" data-width=\"1536\" data-height=\"660\" data-imgfileid=\"100421754\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4b41799f7692af039555c662999e54a31784905819795.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><ul><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">复杂多跳问题Hits@1绝对提升5.1%，Hits@10提升1.2%</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">实体型答案与时间型答案两条赛道都打赢</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">整体Hits@1达0.971——再往上提升已经非常困难</span></section></li></ul><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">TimeQuestions：跨数据集泛化验证</span></h4><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3e0eb7ea22618c77b9363f9e03d05e651784905819796.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.368\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"750\" data-width=\"750\" data-height=\"276\" data-imgfileid=\"100421757\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/3e0eb7ea22618c77b9363f9e03d05e651784905819796.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">迁移到第二个基准同样SOTA，说明方法具有可迁移性，不是针对某个数据集的特化方案。</span></p><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">细粒度问题类型拆解</span></h4><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/138b5d3274856f78c819aab205da8eaa1784905819796.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5991902834008097\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"741\" data-width=\"741\" data-height=\"444\" data-imgfileid=\"100421762\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/138b5d3274856f78c819aab205da8eaa1784905819796.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><strong data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">Before-After</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">这种典型时间排序题，QC-MHM的优势被放大得最明显——这正是“问题校准”模块的主场：只有显式建模了时间约束，模型才知道“之前”意味着什么。</span></p><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">消融实验：三件套缺一不可</span></h4><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4b42062202ce3f2c50cb95842714ecdc1784905819796.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.41295546558704455\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"741\" data-width=\"741\" data-height=\"306\" data-imgfileid=\"100421763\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4b42062202ce3f2c50cb95842714ecdc1784905819796.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d2302898aa0d69e28be48fdeca26c7771784905819796.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.57356608478803\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"802\" data-width=\"802\" data-height=\"460\" data-imgfileid=\"100421759\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d2302898aa0d69e28be48fdeca26c7771784905819796.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">三个模块互相成就，不是简单的“拼盘”，去掉任何一个都会导致特定类型问题大幅退化。</span></p><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">可视化：“白盒”推理路径</span></h4><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1b63116456779f16ec725fa8be9ace8e1784905819796.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.708\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"750\" data-width=\"750\" data-height=\"531\" data-imgfileid=\"100421760\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/1b63116456779f16ec725fa8be9ace8e1784905819796.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">可以清晰地看到模型如何在图中逐跳推进，哪些边被高权重激活——这是过往黑箱模型不具备的能力。</span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e10857409b27d3544b027d938ba56e831784905819796.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.588\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"750\" data-width=\"750\" data-height=\"441\" data-imgfileid=\"100421761\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/e10857409b27d3544b027d938ba56e831784905819796.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">图中高亮的92%、95%等数值，正是问题对最相关时序SPO高度关注的证据，表明门控机制确实抓住了“哪些SPO该被重视”。</span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d9683cd7dee5876e0c044069757b02411784905819796.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.9311740890688259\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"741\" data-width=\"741\" data-height=\"690\" data-imgfileid=\"100421764\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/d9683cd7dee5876e0c044069757b02411784905819796.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">梯度分析印证了问题校准模块确实把关键时序事实反映到了问题向量中。</span></p><h2 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">项目价值</span></h2><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">学术贡献</span></h4><ul><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">首创“问题校准”机制：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">多视角注意力+门控融合，让PLM编码的问题向量主动从KG中提取时序知识，根治“时间盲区”</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">单层多跳聚合：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">用加权组合的方式让单层GNN访问任意跳邻居，同时输出可解释推理路径</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">顺序感知的嵌入辅助任务：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">以“判断时间先后”作为额外监督信号，让嵌入空间隐式编码时间序</span></section></li></ul><h4 data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">落地场景</span></h4><ul><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">搜索引擎：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">精准应答带时间限定词的复杂查询（“之前”“期间”“最早”）</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">金融合规：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">跨时间维度查询股权变更、监管事件、诉讼时序</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">医疗药学：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">追踪疾病演进、用药史、临床试验时间线</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">档案管理：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">跨年代事件因果与关联推理</span></section></li><li><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><span textstyle=\"\">企业BI：</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\">基于时间链路的趋势与因果分析</span></section></li></ul><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\">在LLM普遍强调“事实可追溯”的当下，QC-MHM所代表的“PLM×时序KG×多跳GNN”思路，是构建可信时序推理系统的关键拼图。</span></p><p data-nest-level=\"2\"><em data-nest-level=\"3\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">论文（arXiv）：https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.13188</span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">代码（GitHub）：https://github.com/zhouyan0614-sys/QC-MHM-TKGQA</span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"4\">会议：AAAI（CCF-A），Pages 19332–19340</span></em><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"3\"><br></span></p><section data-nest-level=\"2\"><section data-nest-level=\"3\"><section data-nest-level=\"8\"><p data-nest-level=\"9\"><strong data-nest-level=\"10\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"11\">一键三连</span></strong><span data-nest-level=\"10\"><strong data-nest-level=\"11\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"12\">「点赞」「转发」「小心心」</span></strong></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"9\"><strong data-nest-level=\"10\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"11\">欢迎在评论区留下你的想法！</span></strong></p></section><section data-nest-level=\"8\"><span data-nest-level=\"11\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" data-nest-level=\"11\" /></span></section></section><section data-nest-level=\"3\"><p data-nest-level=\"5\"><span data-nest-level=\"6\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">—&#160;</span><strong data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\">完</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">&#160;—</span></span></p><p data-nest-level=\"5\"><span data-nest-level=\"6\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">【学术投稿】请在工作日发送邮件至：</span></span><span data-nest-level=\"6\"><strong data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\">ai@qbitai.com</span></strong></span><span data-nest-level=\"6\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">，标题注明【投稿】，并告诉我们：</span></span><strong data-nest-level=\"6\"><span data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\">你是谁</span></span></strong><span data-nest-level=\"6\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">，</span><strong data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\">从哪来</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">，</span><strong data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\">投稿内容</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">附上</span><strong data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\">项目/主页链接</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">，以及</span><strong data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\">联系方式</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">。</span></span></p><section data-nest-level=\"5\"><span data-nest-level=\"6\"><span data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\">🎓&#160;</span></span><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">我们会 (尽量) 及时回复你 :)</span></span></section></section><section data-nest-level=\"3\"><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><p data-nest-level=\"5\"><strong data-nest-level=\"6\"><strong data-nest-level=\"7\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"8\">🌟 点亮星标 🌟</span></strong></strong></p><section data-nest-level=\"5\"><strong data-nest-level=\"6\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"7\">科技前沿进展每日见</span></strong></section></section><section data-nest-level=\"4\"><span leaf=\"\" data-nest-level=\"5\"><mp-common-profile data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"量子位\" data-alias=\"QbitAI\" data-from=\"2\" data-headimg=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YicUhk5aAGtCEFSVW5ubo08Zfv1qB5iapricibTBdETkBNtolJxnSUib6UXhjWWz3aib8vETY00P2lKR1uG3qLHicSoWg/0?wx_fmt=png\" data-signature=\"追踪人工智能新趋势，关注科技行业新突破\" data-id=\"MzIzNjc1NzUzMw==\" data-is_biz_ban=\"0\" data-service_type=\"1\"></mp-common-profile></span></section></section></section></div></DIV>","content_text":"QC-MHM团队 投稿 量子位 | 公众号 QbitAI向ChatGPT问一个看起来挺简单的问题：“Lasha Talakhadze之前的奥运举重纪录是多少？”结果让人哭笑不得——模型能认出这个人是谁，也说得出来他拿过金牌，但给出来的答案却是他现在的纪录，而不是“之前”的。同理，“第25届奥运会期间布达佩斯的市长是谁？”这种带时间窗口约束的问题，Google和ChatGPT都翻了车。这不是某个模型的bug，而是所有基于知识图谱的问答系统共有的结构性问题：它们看得见实体，看不见时间。北航、复旦、浙大联合团队在AAAI上提出的QC-MHM（Question Calibration and Multi-Hop Modeling），用一个三件套方案——问题校准+时序嵌入+多跳图推理——让模型真正拥有了“时间感”。作者单位：北京航空航天大学·复旦大学·浙江大学发表：AAAI（CCF-A类顶会，Pages 19332–19340）背景场景与痛点时序知识图谱问答（Temporal KGQA）的任务是：给定一个带时间约束的自然语言问题，从知识图谱中找到落在正确时间窗口内的答案。听起来只是在普通KGQA上加了个时间字段？实际上差距巨大：举个例子：（布达佩斯，市长，某人，1992）和（布达佩斯，市长，另一人，2024）在KG里是两条不同的事实。传统模型很容易把两条混在一起，问“92年谁当市长”时给出2024年的答案。现有方法的两大硬伤学界已经有了CronKGQA、TMA、TSQA等一系列时序KGQA模型，但这篇AAAI论文犀利地指出，它们都没绕过两个坎：硬伤一：PLM对时间“视而不见”。Bert等预训练语言模型编码问题时，注意力天然落在实体名词上（人名、地名），对“之前/之后/期间”这类时间词汇缺乏敏感性。结果就是——模型相当于读了一道“不带时间约束”的问题。硬伤二：图结构信息被浪费。即使用了知识图谱，多数方法也只把它当作答案查询的索引，没有真正利用其中蕴含的多跳关系结构。遇到需要“两步以上跳转”的问题就掉链子，而且推理过程完全黑箱。论文做了什么QC-MHM用一个端到端框架把三个模块串起来：时序感知嵌入：让KG中的时间戳知道“谁在前、谁在后”问题校准：让问题向量主动去KG中“找时间线索”，再回来更新自己的表示多跳GNN推理：单层GNN一次性访问任意跳邻居，同时输出可解释的推理路径技术方案模块一：让时间戳“懂顺序”的KG嵌入KG里每条事实是（主体，关系，客体，时间）四元组。QC-MHM选择TComplEx做基础嵌入，评分函数为：但仅靠TComplEx，时间戳之间还是“散装”的——模型不知道1992在2024之前。为此作者借鉴Transformer的sinusoidal编码，为每个时间戳叠加位置编码：进而构造辅助任务——让模型判断“时间m是否早于时间n”：总训练损失：。这个辅助任务就像给模型做“时间排序”的专项训练——嵌入空间里，1992的向量自然排在2024前面。模块二：问题校准——让问题主动“找时间”这是QC-MHM最具想象力的设计。常规做法是：问题→PLM编码→直接查询答案。QC-MHM在中间加了一步：让问题先去KG中检索与时序相关的SPO（主体-关系-客体三元组），再回来修正自己的表示。第一步：候选SPO召回。把问题和KG中的所有SPO分别过SentenceBERT，用余弦相似度排名，保留Top-10：第二步：三注意力多视角匹配。用三种注意力机制同时比较“问题词×SPO候选”：三种视角各看各的：Concat看“这两个向量放一块合理吗”，Dot看“关键维度上对齐了吗”，Minus看“哪里不一样”。第三步：门控自适应融合。让模型自己决定“原始问题语义”和“从KG检索到的时序信息”各占多大权重：经过校准后的问题向量，从此具备了“时间感”。相当于原本的问题是“XXX是谁？”，校准后变成了“XXX在1992年是谁？”。模块三：多跳GNN推理——一层看穿整条路径传统GNN的问题是：一层只能看1跳邻居，要想看2跳需要堆2层，看3跳得堆3层，效率和可解释性都不好。QC-MHM的做法是：先把子图裁剪出来，再一次性做多跳注意力聚合。子图裁剪：以问题中的实体为起点，抽取k跳范围内的子图，把搜索空间收窄。路径打分（注意力矩阵）：一次性多跳聚合：核心公式在D：通过加权和把1跳、2跳、…、ℓ跳的注意力矩阵一次性合并，让单层GNN就能访问任意跳邻居。经验设置已能取得理想效果。最终图向量：注意力权重本身也可以直接可视化，展示模型的“思考轨迹”——哪条边被高权重激活，推理路径一目了然。模块四：双通道答案预测把语义向量（问题校准后的表示）和图向量（GNN聚合后的表示）拼接，过一层Transformer融合：然后分别投影到实体空间和时间戳空间，用TComplEx评分做双通道预测：两个通道的分数拼接后softmax，交叉熵优化。这意味着——同一个模型可以同时回答“是谁”和“什么时候”两类问题。实验结果CronQuestions：逼近性能天花板复杂多跳问题Hits@1绝对提升5.1%，Hits@10提升1.2%实体型答案与时间型答案两条赛道都打赢整体Hits@1达0.971——再往上提升已经非常困难TimeQuestions：跨数据集泛化验证迁移到第二个基准同样SOTA，说明方法具有可迁移性，不是针对某个数据集的特化方案。细粒度问题类型拆解Before-After这种典型时间排序题，QC-MHM的优势被放大得最明显——这正是“问题校准”模块的主场：只有显式建模了时间约束，模型才知道“之前”意味着什么。消融实验：三件套缺一不可三个模块互相成就，不是简单的“拼盘”，去掉任何一个都会导致特定类型问题大幅退化。可视化：“白盒”推理路径可以清晰地看到模型如何在图中逐跳推进，哪些边被高权重激活——这是过往黑箱模型不具备的能力。图中高亮的92%、95%等数值，正是问题对最相关时序SPO高度关注的证据，表明门控机制确实抓住了“哪些SPO该被重视”。梯度分析印证了问题校准模块确实把关键时序事实反映到了问题向量中。项目价值学术贡献首创“问题校准”机制：多视角注意力+门控融合，让PLM编码的问题向量主动从KG中提取时序知识，根治“时间盲区”单层多跳聚合：用加权组合的方式让单层GNN访问任意跳邻居，同时输出可解释推理路径顺序感知的嵌入辅助任务：以“判断时间先后”作为额外监督信号，让嵌入空间隐式编码时间序落地场景搜索引擎：精准应答带时间限定词的复杂查询（“之前”“期间”“最早”）金融合规：跨时间维度查询股权变更、监管事件、诉讼时序医疗药学：追踪疾病演进、用药史、临床试验时间线档案管理：跨年代事件因果与关联推理企业BI：基于时间链路的趋势与因果分析在LLM普遍强调“事实可追溯”的当下，QC-MHM所代表的“PLM×时序KG×多跳GNN”思路，是构建可信时序推理系统的关键拼图。论文（arXiv）：https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.13188代码（GitHub）：https://github.com/zhouyan0614-sys/QC-MHM-TKGQA会议：AAAI（CCF-A），Pages 19332–19340一键三连「点赞」「转发」「小心心」欢迎在评论区留下你的想法！— 完 —【学术投稿】请在工作日发送邮件至：ai@qbitai.com，标题注明【投稿】，并告诉我们：你是谁，从哪来，投稿内容附上项目/主页链接，以及联系方式。🎓 我们会 (尽量) 及时回复你 :)🌟 点亮星标 🌟科技前沿进展每日见","fetched_at":"2026-07-25T16:22:42.079Z","ok":true}